WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.787
The repository is one folder
with two files per rule.

2
00:00:03.787 --> 00:00:07.913
The rule file is the Graph request
body, in Learn's example shape.

3
00:00:07.913 --> 00:00:11.126
Beside it, a test file names
the tables the query reads,

4
00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:14.339
a known-bad window that must
return at least some rows,

5
00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:17.699
and a known-good window that
must stay under a threshold.

6
00:00:17.699 --> 00:00:20.025
The detection check does four things.

7
00:00:20.025 --> 00:00:23.424
Validates each rule, including
no automated actions,

8
00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:26.437
and that the query starts
from a declared table.

9
00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:31.415
Tests each rule's query over both
windows, through the hunting API.

10
00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:33.350
Reads the deployed rules.

11
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.253
And plans: create, update
only the changed properties,

12
00:00:37.253 --> 00:00:41.740
hold with the reason, and report
orphans, never deleting them.
